--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
OUTPUT PATH RECONCILIATION (no silent drift — covenant #9)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The generated prompt names the output dir `apps/apple/TeslaSync/Features/Analytics/**`.
That path is NOT a project.yml source group; under `apps/apple/TeslaSync/` only the six
surface groups (dashboard-widgets, feature-views, misc-surfaces, modals-dialogs,
shared-surfaces, widget-primitives) are compiled. The repo's real, compiled canonical
page home is `apps/apple/Sources/Features/<Domain>/` — that is where the six shipped
P7 admin pages live (ApiPlayground, DiskForecast, FleetTelemetryCoverage,
LiveSignalInspector, SchemaDrift, TeslaOrders) and where `Sources` is a project.yml
source path with createIntermediateGroups. This page therefore ships at
`apps/apple/Sources/Features/Analytics/**` — the faithful equivalent of the prompt's
`Features/Analytics`. Strings ship in the platform catalog
`apps/apple/Localization/Localizable.xcstrings` (an allowed file). This mapping is the
only deviation from the literal prompt path and matches the six predecessor admin pages.

UNITS RECONCILIATION: the page is **Shared-free** by design. Per ADR-016 the repo ships a
`Shared`-free `MeasurementSystem` precisely so the render/settings layer never imports the
KMP `Shared` framework; the facade bootstrap maps it onto the shared core `UnitPref` at the
display boundary. `AnalyticsFormat` performs the *only* SI→display conversion, at render
time, using the SAME golden-vector constants the shared `Units.kt` engine round-trips
(km↔mi 1.609344, °C↔°F, Wh·km⁻¹↔Wh·mi⁻¹, Wh↔kWh) — verified by the executed harness. The
model stores ONLY SI-derived units (km, kWh, Wh·km⁻¹, km·h⁻¹, kW, °C). Staying Shared-free
keeps the whole view tree isolated-buildable (the proven predecessor methodology).
LIVE/SSE: `useFleetAnalytics` is a polling query, NOT an SSE source (ADR-013) — no live
subscription is required; a >2-minute staleness indicator (TSFreshnessIndicator via
TimelineView) is implemented per ADR-013.

